---
description: Make all CSS changes in the SCSS source file, not in compiled CSS
globs: css/**/*
alwaysApply: true
---

# Styles: Use SCSS

- **Always edit `css/style.scss`** for any CSS/styling changes in this project.
- Do **not** edit `css/style.css` directly — it is generated from the SCSS file (via build/compile).
- After changing `style.scss`, the user may need to run their SCSS compiler (e.g. `sass` or a VS Code task) to update `style.css`.
